        "original_id": "486978cf-4a00-5a1e-80c7-7d9fdc98821a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Game of Life, History of the World\n- People: Milton Bradley, Ragnar Brothers\n- Concepts: player counts, game variations, epochs, empires\n\nFacts:\n- Milton Bradley originally created The Game of Life in 1860 as The Checkered Game of Life.\n- Variations of The Game of Life accommodate eight to ten players.\n- Ragnar Brothers designed History of the World, and it was originally published in 1991.\n- History of the World is played by up to six players across seven epochs, with each player controlling a different empire in each epoch.",
